retrouver son fils, Largo se lance dans une traque sans relâche. Des forêts canadiennes, en passant par Bangkok jusque dans les profondeurs des mines birmanes il ne sait pas encore qu’il devra faire face aux démons du passé."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pZwBoFz1tiexX1oTuux2VZLXFKP.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pZwBoFz1tiexX1oTuux2VZLXFKP.png","language":"it","width":1371,"height":468},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/svL7vMBNFXy7r6LPI28BW004tiv.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/svL7vMBNFXy7r6LPI28BW004tiv.png","language":"fr","width":1842,"height":683},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxKSrBeC1ftLgrg14X5jqL1sh1W.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxKSrBeC1ftLgrg14X5jqL1sh1W.png","language":"fr","width":4319,"height":1177},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fFGzT1dTXYVJSNqeLbDcz7hcBx1.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fFGzT1dTXYVJSNqeLbDcz7hcBx1.png","language":"fr","width":785,"height":166},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kYQv3avUXrwVEqhwJhGFrbAeLZC.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kYQv3avUXrwVEqhwJhGFrbAeLZC.png","language":"fr","width":4319,"height":1177}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rxXafq8UO03PyejyEjqZtZbbiRy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rxXafq8UO03PyejyEjqZtZbbiRy.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/myS41ZUmFvslkT8LeD2irAKxyrf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/myS41ZUmFvslkT8LeD2irAKxyrf.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ccXmqC2J8sglLCATVsphxGbwZr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ccXmqC2J8sglLCATVsphxGbwZr.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"htt